<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Finova resumed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Finova resumed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it had resumed coverage of Finova Group with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the financing company opened up 1/2 to 63-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
